  "outcome_detail": "Relief (ii) granted: definition of 'ordinarily resident' in s 2 of the Citizenship Act is unconstitutional and invalid to the extent that it qualifies the term by requiring a residence permit issued under the Immigration and Deportation Act; relief (iii) dismissed (no breach of Article 79 amendment procedure proved). Each party to bear own costs.",
